# INVWINAM.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: add mode in the
# item list, with the sixty items of TEST/KEYS/RLLONG.REQ.  SPACE outside
# it changes nothing; SHIFT-F8 turns it on, the count panel saying so;
# DOWN then moves the focus row and keeps the selection, SPACE toggles
# the focus row's, the anchor there, and SHIFT-DOWN or a SHIFT click
# adds the rows from the anchor; SHIFT-F8 turns it off, the rows kept,
# and so does a plain click, which selects its row alone; Record > Move
# then asks once for the rows picked.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINAM.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K SPACE
S SPACEOFF
K SHIFT-F8
S ADDON
# items 1 and 3
K DOWN DOWN
S MOVED
K SPACE
S ADD3
# item 4 in, then out again, the anchor there
K DOWN SPACE
S ADD4
K SPACE
S OUT4
# items 4 to 7 added from the anchor
K DOWN DOWN SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
S SHADD
# a SHIFT click on item 12 adds items 4 to 12, the mode kept
M 208.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 11
M 208.1 UP ROW 11
S SHCLICK
K SHIFT-F8
S ADDOFF
K DOWN
S PLAIN
# a plain click on item 3 ends the mode
K SHIFT-F8
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S CLICKOFF
# items 3 and 5, then Move on both
K SHIFT-F8 DOWN DOWN SPACE SHIFT-F8
S PICKED
K ALT-C M
S MOVEASK
K ESC
S MOVEBK
K ALT-F X
